{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_helage_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_helage_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "命途",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_helage_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2f01037fc3ab0052e0d8770a6bb75801606abd1aa99cf749d2ffe5e7c6e4bd53",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 赫拉格"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我們已經站了多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "核心城......都幾乎看不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的傷還沒痊癒，去休息吧，這裡有我就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不是這個意思，就，怎麼講，你明白的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望阿米婭他們能早點回來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擔心領袖的心是好的，這是羅德島向心力的證明。但是否要勉強自己，又是另一碼事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你甚至都站不穩了，年輕人。別對你的同伴隱瞞傷勢，我看得一清二楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你......赫拉格先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫拉格先生說得對，我們遲早會需要你的，但不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "養好傷之後，我們再並肩作戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘿。我一個無名小卒，憑什麼能和耀騎士並肩作戰，這可太抬舉我啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不過，赫拉格先生，現在情況特殊，您還是該待在艦內的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這我當然明白。奈音和其他孩子還在接受檢查，等結束後我自會去安頓好他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是這樣的話......好吧，真要有什麼情況，帶我這個傷患，也只會拖後腿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我先撤了，二位保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開闊的視野，從這裡可以眺望到那座失控的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的視力很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們掩護數支小隊登上了切爾諾伯格，可我從那位醫生的口中聽到的是一個無畏的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但在戰場上，無畏、勇猛、堅決，這些難能可貴的品質往往伴隨著犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無畏並非無謀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我起先沒有料到，你們會是這樣的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......利用沙暴和光線作掩護，即使是訓練有素的士兵，也很難保證這種異想天開的突襲能夠成功，值得讚歎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫拉格先生，我聽說Scout先生最後的遺物，是經由你手回到了羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想說，這是羅德島普遍的品性？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能如此斷論。我想每一位幹員，哪怕是我，與Scout先生所抱有的覺悟都有區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但每一位幹員——此時此刻，願意為感染者，為羅德島而戰的每一個人，都不會畏懼戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人總是為了不同的理由而戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以當他們被許以一個過於宏大，甚至能吻合一切訴求的壯美願景時，他們會迷失在洪流裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是說整合運動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......都是一樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫拉格先生，前往那座城的幹員們，都心懷信念，不曾動搖片刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我選擇相信那個信念，他們的信念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是羅德島幹員的義務，以及，感謝您願意費力帶回Scout先生最後的通訊設備，當時切爾諾伯格的局勢應該十分兇險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可惜，我與那位戰士未曾謀面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的犧牲足以讓戰士動容。這使我相信他的意志至今仍有跡可循。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但“犧牲”一詞並非往事，眼下這場仗，羅德島還會犧牲許多，甚至更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起犧牲，我們更該在意犧牲換來的是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我的職責僅僅是在此處守望，等待他們的流血與奮鬥換回正義的成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我曾見過不少像你這樣的卡西米爾人，年輕的騎士，但他們多有缺失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽那些幹員稱呼你為耀騎士，你先前的表現的確令人印象深刻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——據我所知，在如今的卡西米爾，只持一字封號的騎士，無一例外都是他們之中的佼佼者，你為何離開了故土？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在如今的卡西米爾，騎士的含義也大不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也離開了烏薩斯，這是您說的，每個人都為不同的理由而戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕的耀騎士，你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪嘉烈·臨光。或者，幹員代號，臨光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以......他們稱你為“臨光”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W在哪！？這種時候——她為什麼不在這裡！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......現在你還指望她？加爾森怎麼死的，我們都心知肚明不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別廢話！W也好，塔露拉也好，天知道她們在想什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都是拿錢賣命的，對吧，別被這些感染者影響了，他們要的是他們的未來，和我們沒有半點關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把眼前的敵人幹掉，然後，跟著活下去的那一方繼續走，這就是我的方針！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，告訴我，W聯絡不上，塔露拉棄置了我們，在這兩個人，隨便誰，再次給我們一個命令之前，告訴我，你們該聽誰的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cenbri"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生了什麼？這些薩卡茲怎麼都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們產生了混亂，我們趁機溜過去，快......別被發現......我們得按計畫確保——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_089",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時至今日，我仍記得巴克萊那晚露出的表情。哪怕銀槍的皮加索斯親臨戰場一線，他也沒露出過那股複雜神色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說，除了銀槍的皮加索斯之外，我們又多了一個金色的對手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金色。金色的天馬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一名剛嶄露頭角的軍事統帥，在數小時內重組了本已經被突襲打散的眾多騎士團，在那處峽谷，只靠血肉步卒據守了三月有餘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他讓烏薩斯損失了遠超預想的數字，使得集團軍不得不調配高速軍艦打破既定的陣型，也使得冬季行動不得不縮小規模。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "臨光家族應該被卡西米爾奉為英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是現在，繼承了他血脈的年輕孩子......卻被逐出了卡西米爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些卑劣的往事......不值得赫拉格先生深究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但無論我在大地何處，我仍以臨光二字為豪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的祖父還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......上一次與家鄉聯絡，祖父已經臥病不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歲月......歲月總是出人意料。戰爭留下了英雄，也留下了創口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你痛恨烏薩斯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我從未親身經歷戰爭，赫拉格先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我深知烏薩斯帶去了許多場慘烈的戰爭，這個事實不會改變。而不少卡西米爾人也都痛恨烏薩斯人，哪怕，直到今日。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......否定這種痛恨，教那些在戰爭中失去了親人與土地的人不去痛恨，這種行為近乎一種酷刑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是一位軍人......但我並非征戰騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你仍是個卡西米爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我也從未否認過這一點，我願意為阿米婭傾訴的那個理想，為感染者而戰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——但也許遲早有一天，我還是會回到卡西米爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還年輕，耀騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......你還年輕。你還有糾正自己和這一切的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_graduate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......這不可能......梅菲斯特他......他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼？異變？喂，你們還聽得懂......唔......啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊......啊......讓......讓他們......走......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動A",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉背叛了我們！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動B",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能！愛國者才是真正的叛徒！殺了他！他是個薩卡茲，是個溫迪戈，還是個烏薩斯軍人！他有什麼可信任的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖。現在輪到我們站隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼說？W只留了個駐紮的命令就沒影了，她是不是已經被塔露拉殺了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他隊伍......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聯繫不上，現在那些感染者瘋子已經開始圍攻愛國者了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不過大部分人還在混亂，這就對了，他們又不是軍人，這場變故比我聽聞的任何一次政變都要突然——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去找愛國者的隊伍會合？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——薩卡茲寧願跟著薩卡茲混，這不是鐵律嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，他可是博卓卡斯替啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切爾諾伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "似乎它的腳步仍沒有停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您在那生活了很久嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不算太久，很不幸，我的壽命比尋常烏薩斯人稍長一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你說生活......我的確生活在那座城市裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能想像嗎？那曾經也是一座有遊樂場、百貨商店和人造湖泊公園的移動城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，核心城拋棄了那些被天災摧毀的廢城區，它輕易地把多少代人建立起來的東西拋棄了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至連這座城市自己，都要為了一個可怕的陰謀捐軀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切爾諾伯格並不算美輪美奐，工廠污染了天空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但那裡有多少無辜的烏薩斯人的生活，這些事情，那些發起陰謀的幕後黑手，有誰去想過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "憤怒蒙蔽了他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒙蔽了所有人，我們都不例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我看見的，那不是一座城市。是以無數人生活的毀滅作燃料，被野心驅動的暴力的機器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們利用了所有人生存的意志。他們先是取走了感染者生存的權利，最後連他們的意志都要剝奪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您在那裡的診所......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我所建立起的東西，被摧毀過太多次。只要奈音他們沒事，廢墟就只是磚瓦，還不是毀滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奈音他們沒事，而羅德島的確能提供治療，這是我唯一欣慰的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您把他們保護得很好，否則，在整合運動癱瘓城市後，從切爾諾伯格安全撤出近乎天方夜譚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只想保護好他們而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您甚至放棄了烏薩斯將領的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的，但烏薩斯的土地仍在追逐我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而有時候，看著切爾諾伯格開動的時候，我曾分不清是烏薩斯在追逐我，還是在遠離我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您不願與烏薩斯為敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏薩斯——在它腐朽的身軀沉沒在無止境的進軍中之前，這片大地不該有任何人或事物與烏薩斯為敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾將生命奉獻給烏薩斯，戰爭是軍人的天職，我只是履行了我信任過的職責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......只是時至今日，我已經走出了那片泥沼，得以從別的視角眺望我曾經生活過的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——如同你一樣，耀騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個卡西米爾人、薩米人、龍門人，會如何看待歷代陛下的指點對這片大地的深遠影響？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們是如何看待與烏薩斯的戰爭的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說，你未曾經歷戰爭。你還年輕，你還有回避這些問題的權利。但答案我們心知肚明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰爭沒有答案，戰爭不需要答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......暴力改變不了任何事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......暴力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先皇曾令烏薩斯榮耀，我們曾窮其一生為之奮鬥的宏願，如他所說，烏薩斯不過是他雙手的延伸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他是否真的有把烏薩斯所有的子民，看作烏薩斯的一部分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他會不會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛國者死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個烏薩斯的間諜死了！他不可信！塔露拉將帶領感染者走向勝利！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓塔露拉和她那些蠢笨的衛士明白，她屈服不了這裡所有的意志！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓他們吠叫，讓他們掙扎，叛徒都會被受奴役者之盾碾壓而過，我們會連成山脈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_058",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了大尉！為了......愛國者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......愛國者......那個溫迪戈？博卓卡斯替？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是，核心城的指揮塔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它在燃燒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭......她們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這只是一個開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動的領袖不是個尋常感染者。她的實力謀略並非她最真實的一面，盤繞在整合運動背後的巨大陰影已經露出了獠牙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都得小心，當他們的奸計得逞，羅德島，龍門，感染者，沒有人能逃離一場新的洪流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不知道阿米婭面對的是什麼樣的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的領袖，她比你更年輕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動煽動起的感染者暴徒，潛藏在其中的幕後黑手，又或者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們會直面愛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "複述他的名字吧，他名副其實——純血的溫迪戈，烏薩斯軍人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者說，北原感染者遊擊隊的領袖，博卓卡斯替。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他會是攔在羅德島與整合運動之間的最後一道壁壘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我在緊急臨時會議上聽聞過這個名字。我很少看見凱爾希醫生如此謹慎對待一個敵人......一個敵人個體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他當得上這份謹慎，有過之而無不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽上去，二位是舊識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們曾是戰友，而他是一個真正的戰士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與他的血統無關，與他的軍功與身份都無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——把溫迪戈稱作烏薩斯人，讓你感到意外嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身份和思想不應被出身決定，這一點我已經習以為常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您似乎覺得羅德島勝算更小？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博卓卡斯替走不出他為自己劃下的邊界，為了他的理想，為了......他所相信的理想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島為了實現自身目的而選擇斬首塔露拉，這很莽撞，但也是實現一個折衷結果的唯一辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但他不同。他挑起了那個象徵著感染者與反抗者的形象，放任這個符號不斷放大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合運動因他而有力，也會因此，成為他最大的軟肋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是指？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "命運把他牽扯到了一個死局之中，他早有意識，但也絕不會屈服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他會戰鬥到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他會迎來死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
